hadiths[85]{hadithnumber,text}:
"213","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, wo kehte they: Musalman jab Madina aaye to jama hote aur namaz ka waqt maloom karte, us ke liye elan nahi hota tha. Phir ek din unhon ne is bare mein guftagu ki. To un mein se kuchh ne kaha: Nasara ke naqoos jaisa naqoos bana lo. Aur un mein se kuchh ne kaha: Balke Yahood ke bigul jaisa bigul. To Hazrat Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Kya tum ek shakhs nahi bhejte jo namaz ka elan kare? To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ae Bilal! Khade ho aur namaz ka elan karo."
"214","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Logon ne aag aur naqoos ka zikr kiya. To unhon ne Yahood aur Nasara ka zikr kiya. Phir Bilal ko hukm diya gaya ke wo azan ko dohra kahein aur iqamat ko ek martaba kahein."
"215","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum elan suno to waisa hi kaho jaisa muazzin kehta hai."
"216","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab namaz ke liye pukara jata hai to shaitan peeth pher kar bhagta hai jabke us se hawa kharij hoti hai taake wo azan na sune. Phir jab elan poora ho jata hai to wapas aata hai. Yahan tak ke jab namaz ke liye iqamat kahi jati hai to peeth pher kar bhagta hai. Yahan tak ke jab iqamat poori ho jati hai to wapas aata hai. Yahan tak ke aadmi aur us ke dil ke darmiyan khayal dalta hai. Kehta hai: Falan yaad karo, falan yaad karo, jo wo yaad na karta tha. Yahan tak ke aadmi is haal mein rehta hai ke wo nahi janta ke us ne kitni parhi."
"217","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko dekha ke jab Aap namaz mein khade hote to apne dono hath uthate yahan tak ke wo dono kandhon ke barabar hote. Aur Aap aisa karte jab ruku ke liye takbeer kehte, aur aisa karte jab apna sar ruku se uthate aur farmate: Allah ne us ki sun li jo Us ki hamd kare. Aur Aap sajde mein aisa na karte."
"218","[AI-translation] Hazrat Malik bin al-Huwairith se Abu Qilaba ke hawale se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Malik bin al-Huwairith ko dekha ke jab wo namaz parhte to takbeer kehte aur apne dono hath uthate, aur jab ruku karna chahte to apne dono hath uthate, aur jab ruku se apna sar uthate to apne dono hath uthate. Aur unhon ne bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne aisa hi kiya."
"219","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo unhe namaz parhate to jab jhukte aur uthte takbeer kehte. Phir jab phirte to farmate: Beshak main tum mein Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki namaz se sab se zyada mushabeh namaz parhta hun."
"220","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab namaz ke liye khade hote to khade hote waqt takbeer kehte, phir ruku karte waqt takbeer kehte. Phir farmate: Allah ne us ki sun li jo Us ki hamd kare, jab ruku se apni peeth uthate. Phir khade hote hue farmate: Ae hamare Rab! Tere liye hamd hai. Phir jhukte waqt takbeer kehte, phir apna sar uthate waqt takbeer kehte. Phir sajda karte waqt takbeer kehte, phir apna sar uthate waqt takbeer kehte. Phir poori namaz mein aisa karte yahan tak ke use poora karte. Aur do rakaton se baithne ke baad uthte waqt takbeer kehte."
"221","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain se Mutarrif bin Abdullah ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ali bin Abi Talib ke peechhe namaz parhi, main aur Imran bin Husain. To wo jab sajda karte to takbeer kehte, jab apna sar uthate to takbeer kehte, aur jab do rakaton se uthte to takbeer kehte. Phir jab unhon ne namaz poori ki to Imran bin Husain ne mera hath pakda aur farmaya: Beshak is ne mujhe Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki namaz yaad dila di. Ya kaha: Beshak is ne hamein Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki namaz parhayi."
"222","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ubada bin al-Samit (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Us ki namaz nahi jis ne Surah Fatiha na parhi."
"223","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) masjid mein dakhil hue. Phir ek shakhs dakhil hua aur namaz parhi. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko salam kiya. To Aap ne use jawab diya aur farmaya: Laut ja aur namaz parh, kyunke tum ne namaz nahi parhi. Phir wo lauta aur us ne aise hi namaz parhi jaise pehle parhi thi. Phir Aap ke paas aaya aur Aap ko salam kiya. To Aap ne farmaya: Aur tum par salam ho, laut ja aur namaz parh, kyunke tum ne namaz nahi parhi. Teen martaba. Phir us ne arz kiya: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ne Aap ko haq ke sath bheja! Main is se behtar nahi janta, to mujhe sikhayiye. Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum namaz ke liye khade ho to takbeer kaho. Phir Quran mein se jo tumhe aasan ho parho. Phir ruku karo yahan tak ke ruku mein mutma'in ho jao. Phir utho yahan tak ke khade hokar seedhe ho jao. Phir sajda karo yahan tak ke sajde mein mutma'in ho jao. Phir utho yahan tak ke baith kar mutma'in ho jao. Phir apni poori namaz mein aisa karo."
"224","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jab imam Aameen kahe to tum Aameen kaho, kyunke jis ka Aameen farishton ke Aameen ke muwafiq ho gaya us ke pichhle gunah bakhsh diye jayenge."
"225","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi Aameen kahe aur aasman mein farishte Aameen kahein aur ek doosre ke muwafiq ho jayein to us ke pichhle gunah bakhsh diye jayenge."
"226","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Samura (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab Fajr ki namaz parhte to baithte, ya thehre rehte, yahan tak ke suraj achhi tarah nikal aata. Aur Aap Hansi wali koi baat na karte jo jahiliyat mein hanste they magar muskurate."
"227","[AI-translation] Hazrat Simak bin Harb se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir bin Samura se poochha: Kya tum Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki majlis mein baithe? To unhon ne kaha: Haan, bahut zyada. Aap apni namaz ki jagah se na uthte jahan Aap ne subah ki namaz parhi hoti, yahan tak ke suraj nikal aata. Phir jab suraj nikal aata to Aap uthte. Aur log baatein karte aur jahiliyat ke mamle ki hansi ki baat karte to wo hanste jabke Aap muskurate."
"228","[AI-translation] Umm al-Muminin Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Asr ki do rakatein mere paas kabhi tark na farmate."
"229","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ne Aap ko wafat di! Aap ne unhe kabhi tark na farmaya yahan tak ke Allah se ja mile. Aur Aap unhe kabhi na milte magar khafif parhte, kyunke Aap namaz parhte. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Aap unhe khade hokar parhte, baith kar nahi. Balke Aap tawaf karte [yani nafl parhte] khade hokar."
"230","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab bimari, ya budhapa, ya kamzori se namaz parhte to baith kar parhte. Phir jab aakhri ayat ke qareeb hote to khade ho jate aur parhte, phir ruku karte."
"231","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab imam [ghair al-maghdubi alaihim wa la al-dallin] kahe to tum Aameen kaho. Kyunke jis ka qaul farishton ke qaul ke muwafiq ho gaya us ke pichhle gunah bakhsh diye jayenge."
"232","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ghode se gir gaye to Aap ka dayan pehlu chhil gaya. Phir hum Aap ki ayadat ke liye Aap ke paas dakhil hue. Phir namaz ka waqt aaya to Aap ne hamein baith kar namaz parhayi, to hum baith gaye. Phir jab Aap ne namaz poori ki to farmaya: Imam is liye banaya gaya hai ke us ki pairwi ki jaye. Phir jab wo takbeer kahe to tum takbeer kaho, jab wo ruku kare to tum ruku karo, jab wo uthaye to tum uthao, jab wo kahe ke Allah ne us ki sun li jo Us ki hamd kare to tum kaho ke ae hamare Rab! Tere liye hamd hai, aur jab wo sajda kare to tum sajda karo."
"233","[AI-translation] Umm al-Muminin Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apne ghar mein namaz parhi jabke Aap beemar they. To Aap ne baith kar namaz parhi aur Aap ke peechhe ek jamaat ne khade hokar namaz parhi. To Aap ne unhe ishara farmaya ke baith jao. Phir jab Aap phire to farmaya: Imam is liye banaya gaya hai ke us ki pairwi ki jaye. Phir jab wo ruku kare to tum ruku karo, jab wo uthaye to tum uthao, aur jab wo baith kar namaz parhe to tum baith kar parho."
"234","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Imam is liye banaya gaya hai ke us ki pairwi ki jaye. Phir jab wo takbeer kahe to tum takbeer kaho, jab wo ruku kare to tum ruku karo, jab wo kahe ke Allah ne us ki sun li jo Us ki hamd kare to tum kaho ke ae hamare Rab! Tere liye hamd hai, jab wo sajda kare to tum sajda karo, aur jab wo baith kar namaz parhe to tum sab baith kar parho."
"235","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utba ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Aisha ke paas dakhil hua aur arz kiya: Kya tum mujhe Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki bimari ke bare mein bayan nahi karogin? Unhon ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par bojh badh gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya logon ne namaz parh li? Hum ne arz kiya: Nahi, wo Aap ka intezar kar rahe hain. Aap ne farmaya: Mere liye lagan mein pani rakho. Unhon ne kaha: Phir hum ne aisa kiya. To Aap baithe aur ghusl farmaya. Phir uthne lage to Aap par behoshi tari ho gayi, phir Aap hosh mein aaye. To Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kya logon ne namaz parh li? Hum ne arz kiya: Nahi, wo Aap ka intezar kar rahe hain Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Mere liye lagan mein pani rakho. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Aap baithe aur ghusl farmaya. Phir uthne lage to Aap par behoshi tari ho gayi, phir Aap hosh mein aaye aur farmaya: Kya logon ne namaz parh li? Hum ne arz kiya: Nahi, wo Aap ka intezar kar rahe hain Ya Rasulullah! Phir Aap ne farmaya: Mere liye lagan mein pani rakho. Phir Aap baithe aur ghusl farmaya. Phir uthne lage to Aap par behoshi tari ho gayi, phir Aap hosh mein aaye aur farmaya: Kya logon ne namaz parh li? To hum ne arz kiya: Nahi, wo Aap ka intezar kar rahe hain Ya Rasulullah! Aur log masjid mein thehre hue they, Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka aakhri Isha ki namaz ke liye intezar kar rahe they. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Abu Bakr ki taraf bheja ke wo logon ko namaz parhaye. Phir Aap ka qasid un ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: Beshak Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tumhe hukm farmate hain ke tum logon ko namaz parhao. To Abu Bakr ne kaha, jo narm-dil shakhs they: Ae Umar! Logon ko namaz parhao. To Umar ne un se kaha: Tum is ke zyada haq-dar ho. Phir Abu Bakr ne un dino namaz parhayi. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apne aap mein halka-pan paya to do mardon ke darmiyan nikle, ek Abbas, Zuhr ki namaz ke liye, jabke Abu Bakr logon ko namaz parha rahe they. Phir jab Abu Bakr ne Aap ko dekha to peechhe hatne lage. To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhe ishara farmaya ke peechhe na hato. Aap ne farmaya: Mujhe un ke pehlu mein bithao. Phir unhon ne Aap ko Abu Bakr ke pehlu mein bithaya. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Abu Bakr namaz parhne lage jabke wo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki namaz ki pairwi kar rahe they, aur log Abu Bakr ki namaz ki pairwi kar rahe they, jabke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) baithe they. Ubaidullah ne kaha: Phir main Abdullah bin Abbas ke paas dakhil hua aur un se arz kiya: Kya main tumhe wo pesh na karun jo Aisha ne mujhe Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki bimari ke bare mein bayan kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Lao. Phir main ne unhe un ki hadith pesh ki to unhon ne is mein se kisi cheez ka inkar na kiya, magar unhon ne kaha: Kya unhon ne tumhe us shakhs ka naam bataya jo Abbas ke sath tha? Main ne arz kiya: Nahi. Unhon ne kaha: Wo Ali hain."
"236","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par bojh badh gaya aur Aap ka dard sakht ho gaya to Aap ne apni biwiyon se ijazat mangi ke Aap ki timar-dari mere ghar mein ki jaye. To unhon ne Aap ko ijazat de di. Phir Aap do mardon ke darmiyan nikle jabke Aap ke dono paon zameen par ghisat rahe they, aur Aap Abbas aur ek aur shakhs ke darmiyan they. Phir Ubaidullah [hadith ke rawi] ne kaha: Phir main ne Ibn Abbas se wo zikr kiya jo Aisha ne kaha tha. To unhon ne farmaya: Kya tum jante ho wo shakhs kaun hai jis ka Aisha ne naam nahi liya? Main ne arz kiya: Nahi. Unhon ne kaha: Wo Ali bin Abi Talib hain."
"237","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Beshak main ne is bare mein Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se bahut guftagu ki. Aur mujhe kasrat se Aap se guftagu par sirf is ne ubhara ke mere dil mein ye na baitha ke log Aap ke baad kabhi us shakhs se mohabbat karenge jo Aap ki jagah khada hoga. Aur main na samajhti thi ke Aap ki jagah koi khada hoga magar log use manhoos samjhenge. To main ne chaha ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) isے Abu Bakr se pher dein."
"238","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apni us bimari mein beemar hue jis mein Aap ki wafat hui to namaz ka waqt aaya aur azan kahi gayi. To Aap ne farmaya: Abu Bakr ko hukm do ke wo logon ko namaz parhaye. To Aap se arz kiya gaya: Beshak Abu Bakr narm-dil shakhs hain, jab wo Aap ki jagah khade honge to logon ko namaz na parha sakenge. Aur Aap ne doharaya to unhon ne Aap se doharaya. Phir Aap ne teesri martaba doharaya aur farmaya: Beshak tum Yusuf ki sathiyan ho. Abu Bakr ko hukm do ke wo logon ko namaz parhaye. Phir Abu Bakr nikle aur namaz parhayi. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apne aap mein halka-pan paya. To Aap do mardon ke darmiyan sahara diye hue nikle, goya main Aap ke dono paon dekh rahi hun jo dard se zameen par ghisat rahe hain. Phir Abu Bakr ne peechhe hatna chaha to Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhe ishara farmaya ke apni jagah raho. Phir Aap ko laya gaya yahan tak ke Aap un ke pehlu mein baithe. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) namaz parh rahe they, aur Abu Bakr Aap ki namaz se namaz parh rahe they, aur log Abu Bakr ki namaz se namaz parh rahe they."
"239","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par bojh badh gaya to Bilal Aap ko namaz ki khabar dene aaye. To Aap ne farmaya: Abu Bakr ko hukm do ke wo logon ko namaz parhaye. To main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Abu Bakr narm-dil shakhs hain aur jab wo Aap ki jagah khade honge to logon ko na suna sakenge. To agar Aap Umar ko hukm farmate. Aap ne farmaya: Abu Bakr ko hukm do ke wo logon ko namaz parhaye. To main ne Hafsa se kaha: Un se kaho ke Abu Bakr narm-dil shakhs hain, aur jab wo Aap ki jagah khade honge to logon ko na suna sakenge. To agar Aap Umar ko hukm farmate. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak tum Yusuf ki sathiyan ho. Abu Bakr ko hukm do ke wo logon ko namaz parhaye. Phir jab wo namaz mein dakhil hue to Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apne aap mein halka-pan paya. To Aap do mardon ke darmiyan sahara diye hue khade hue, jabke Aap ke dono paon zameen mein ghisat rahe they, yahan tak ke Aap masjid mein dakhil hue. Phir jab Abu Bakr ne Aap ki aahat suni to Abu Bakr peechhe hatne lage. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhe ishara farmaya. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aaye yahan tak ke Abu Bakr ke bayein baithe. Phir Abu Bakr khade hokar namaz parh rahe they, aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) baith kar namaz parh rahe they. Abu Bakr Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki namaz ki pairwi kar rahe they, aur log Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ki namaz ki pairwi kar rahe they."
"240","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik al-Ansari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, jo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke peechhe chale, Aap ki khidmat ki aur Aap ki sohbat ikhtiyar ki, ke Abu Bakr unhe Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki us bimari mein namaz parha rahe they jis mein Aap ki wafat hui. Yahan tak ke jab Peer ka din tha jabke wo namaz mein safein bandhe they, to Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hujre ka parda uthaya, hamein dekh rahe they jabke Aap khade they, goya Aap ka chehra mushaf ka waraq hai. Phir Aap hanste hue muskuraye. Phir hum ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko dekhne ki khushi se fitne mein padne ka irada kiya. Phir Abu Bakr apni ediyon par peechhe hate taake saf se mil jayein, aur unhon ne gumaan kiya ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) namaz ke liye nikal rahe hain. To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein ishara farmaya ke apni namaz poori karo. Aur Aap ne parda gira diya. Phir Aap ki usi din wafat ho gayi."
"241","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) teen din na nikle. Phir namaz khadi ki gayi. To Abu Bakr aage badhne lage. Phir Nabiullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne parde se farmaya aur use uthaya. Phir jab Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka chehra wazeh hua to hum ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke chehre se zyada pasandeeda manzar na dekha jab wo hamare liye wazeh hua. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apne hath se Abu Bakr ki taraf ishara farmaya ke aage badho. Aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne parda gira diya. Phir Aap par wafat tak قابو na paya gaya."
"242","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) beemar hue aur Aap ki bimari sakht ho gayi. To Aap ne farmaya: Abu Bakr ko hukm do ke wo logon ko namaz parhaye. Aisha ne kaha: Wo narm-mizaj shakhs hain, jab wo Aap ki jagah khade honge to logon ko namaz na parha sakenge. Aap ne farmaya: Abu Bakr ko hukm do ke wo logon ko namaz parhaye. Phir unhon ne doharaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Abu Bakr ko hukm do ke wo logon ko namaz parhaye, kyunke tum Yusuf ki sathiyan ho. Phir Aap ka qasid un ke paas aaya to unhon ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zindagi mein logon ko namaz parhayi."
"243","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd al-Sa'idi (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) sulah ke liye Bani Amr bin Auf ke paas gaye. Phir namaz ka waqt aaya. To muazzin Abu Bakr ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: Kya tum logon ko namaz parhaoge aur main iqamat kahun? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Phir Abu Bakr ne namaz parhayi. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aaye jabke log namaz mein they. Phir Aap nikal kar saf mein khade ho gaye. Phir logon ne taliyan bajayein. Aur Abu Bakr apni namaz mein tawajjah na karte they. Phir jab logon ne taliyan kasrat se bajayein to unhon ne tawajjah ki aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko dekha. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhe ishara farmaya ke apni jagah raho. Phir Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ne apne dono hath uthaye aur Allah ki hamd ki us par jo Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhe is ka hukm farmaya tha. Phir Abu Bakr peechhe hate yahan tak ke saf mein barabar ho gaye. Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aage badhe aur namaz parhayi. Phir jab Aap phire to farmaya: Ae Abu Bakr! Tumhe qayam rehne se kis ne roka jab main ne tumhe hukm farmaya tha? To Abu Bakr ne kaha: Abu Quhafa ke bete ke liye jayez na tha ke wo Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke samne namaz parhaye. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe kya hua ke main ne tumhe taliyan kasrat se bajate dekha? Jo namaz mein kisi cheez mein shak kare use chahiye ke SubhanAllah kahe. Kyunke jab wo SubhanAllah kahega to us ki taraf tawajjah ki jayegi. Aur taliyan bajana aurton ke liye hai."
"244","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Tasbeeh mardon ke liye hai aur taliyan bajana aurton ke liye hai."
"245","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum mera Qibla yahan dekhte ho? Allah ki qasam! Mujh par tumhara khushu aur tumhara ruku chhupa nahi hai. Beshak main tumhe apni peeth ke peechhe se dekhta hun."
"246","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Ruku aur sajda qayam karo. Allah ki qasam! Beshak main tumhe apne peechhe se dekhta hun, aur kabhi farmaya: Apni peeth ke peechhe se, jab tum ruku karte ho aur sajda karte ho."
"247","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum mein se ek nahi darta, ya kya tum mein se ek nahi darta ke jab wo imam se pehle apna sar uthaye ke Allah us ka sar gadhe ka sar bana de, ya Allah us ki surat gadhe ki surat bana de?"
"248","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Apni safein seedhi karo, kyunke safon ka seedha karna namaz qayam karne mein se hai."
"249","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Safein qayam karo, kyunke beshak main tumhe apni peeth ke peechhe se dekhta hun."
"250","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nu'man bin Bashir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum apni safein zaroor seedhi karoge, warna Allah tumhare chehron ke darmiyan mukhalifat dal dega."
"251","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Agar log jante jo elan aur pehli saf mein hai, phir use qura-andazi ke siwa na pate to us par qura-andazi karte. Aur agar jante jo dopahar mein jaldi aane mein hai to us ki taraf sabqat karte. Aur agar jante jo Isha aur Fajr mein hai to un dono mein aate agarche ghisat kar."
"252","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Log Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath namaz parhte they jabke un ke tehband un ki gardanon par bandhe they, bachchon ki haalat ki tarah. Aur aurton se kaha jata: Apne sar na uthao yahan tak ke mard baith kar barabar ho jayein."
"253","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai: Jab tum mein se kisi ki biwi masjid jane ki ijazat mange to wo use na roke."
"254","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Umar ki ek biwi Fajr aur Isha ki namaz jamaat se masjid mein ada karti thein. To un se kaha gaya: Tum kyun nikalti ho jabke tum janti ho ke Umar ise na-pasand karte hain aur ghairat karte hain? Unhon ne kaha: Use mujhe manع karne se kya rokta hai? Unhon ne kaha: Use Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka qaul rokta hai: Allah ki bandiyon ko Allah ki masjiden manع na karo."
"255","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Agar Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) dekhte jo aurton ne naya nikala hai to unhe masjiden manع kar dete jaise Bani Israil ki aurton ko manع kiya gaya tha."
"256","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se [aur apni namaz na buland kaho aur na aahista kaho] ke bare mein riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ye nazil hui jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Makkah mein chhupe they. Phir Aap jab awaz buland karte to mushrik sunte aur Quran ko, use nazil karne wale ko aur use lane wale ko gali dete. To Allah Ta'ala ne farmaya [aur apni namaz na buland kaho aur na aahista kaho]: Apni namaz buland na kaho yahan tak ke mushrik sunein, aur use apne sathiyon se aahista na kaho ke tum unhe na sunao [aur is ke darmiyan rasta talash karo]: Unhe sunao aur buland na kaho yahan tak ke wo tum se Quran lein."
"257","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se Us ke qaul [apni zaban ko us se jaldi ke liye harkat na do] ke bare mein riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab Jibreel wahi lekar nazil hote to Aap un mein se they jo us se apni zaban aur honth hilate, phir Aap par sakhti hoti. Aur Aap se pehchana jata. To Allah ne wo ayat nazil farmayi jo [main Qayamat ke din ki qasam khata hun] mein hai [apni zaban ko us se jaldi ke liye harkat na do, beshak hum par us ka jama karna aur parhana hai]. Unhon ne kaha: Hum par hai ke use tumhare seene mein jama karein, aur us ka parhana [phir jab hum use parhein to us ke parhne ki pairwi karo]: Phir jab hum use nazil karein to suno [phir beshak hum par us ki wazahat hai]: Hum par hai ke use tumhari zaban se wazeh karein. Unhon ne kaha: Phir jab Jibreel Aap ke paas aate to Aap sar jhuka lete, phir jab wo chale jate to Aap use parhte jaisa Allah ne Aap se wada farmaya tha."
"258","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se Allah Ta'ala ke qaul [apni zaban ko us se jaldi ke liye harkat na do] ke bare mein riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) nazil hone mein sakhti jhelte they, aur Aap un mein se they jo apne honth hilate. To Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Main unhe tumhare liye hilata hun jaisa Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) unhe hilate they. Aur Sa'id ne kaha [wo Sa'id bin Jubair hain jo Ibn Abbas se hadith riwayat karte hain]: Main unhe hilata hun jaisa main ne Ibn Abbas ko hilate dekha. Phir unhon ne apne honth hilaye. Phir Allah Ta'ala ne ye nazil farmaya [apni zaban ko us se jaldi ke liye harkat na do, beshak hum par us ka jama karna aur parhana hai]. Unhon ne kaha: Us ka jama karna tumhare seene mein aur tum use parho [phir jab hum use parhein to us ke parhne ki pairwi karo]. Unhon ne kaha: To use suno aur khamosh raho [phir beshak hum par us ki wazahat hai]: Phir beshak hum par hai ke tum use parho. Phir is ke baad Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab Jibreel Aap ke paas aate to sunte, phir jab Jibreel chale jate to Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) use parhte jaisa unhon ne parha tha."
"259","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apne sathiyon mein se ek jamaat ke sath Ukaz ke bazar ka irada karke nikle. Jabke shaitanon aur aasman ki khabar ke darmiyan rok bana di gayi thi, aur un par angare bheje gaye they. Phir shaitan apni qaum ki taraf laute. To unhon ne kaha: Tumhe kya hua? Unhon ne kaha: Hamare aur aasman ki khabar ke darmiyan rok bana di gayi hai, aur hum par angare bheje gaye hain. Unhon ne kaha: Tumhare aur aasman ki khabar ke darmiyan sirf koi nayi cheez hail hui hai. To zameen ke mashriq aur maghrib mein phail jao aur dekho ye kya hai jo tumhare aur aasman ki khabar ke darmiyan hail hua hai. Phir wo jo Tihama ki taraf gaye they, Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki taraf laute, jabke Aap Nakhla mein Ukaz ke bazar ka irada kiye they, aur Aap apne sathiyon ko Fajr ki namaz parha rahe they. Phir jab unhon ne Quran suna to use suna. Phir unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Yehi hai jo tumhare aur aasman ki khabar ke darmiyan hail hua hai. Phir wahin jab wo apni qaum ki taraf laute to unhon ne kaha: [Ae hamari qaum! Beshak hum ne ajeeb Quran suna hai jo bhalayi ki rah dikhata hai. Phir hum us par iman laye aur hum apne Rab ke sath kisi ko shareek nahi karenge]. Phir Allah ne apne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par ye nazil farmaya [kaho meri taraf wahi ki gayi hai ke jinnon ke ek giroh ne suna]. Aur Aap ki taraf sirf jinnon ka qaul wahi kiya gaya tha."
"260","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Qatada (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Zuhr ki namaz ki pehli do rakaton mein Surah Fatiha aur do surtein parhte, pehli mein lambi karte aur doosri mein chhoti karte, aur kabhi ayat sunate. Aur Aap Asr mein Surah Fatiha aur do surtein parhte, aur pehli mein lambi karte. Aur Aap Fajr ki namaz ki pehli rakat mein lambi karte aur doosri mein chhoti karte."
"261","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas se Jabir bin Samura ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Kufa walon ne Sa'd ki Umar (raziyallahu anhu) se shikayat ki. To unhon ne use mazool kar diya aur un par Ammar ko muqarrar kiya. Phir unhon ne shikayat ki yahan tak ke unhon ne zikr kiya ke wo achhi tarah namaz nahi parhata. To unhon ne unhe bulaya aur farmaya: Ae Abu Ishaq! Beshak ye kehte hain ke tum achhi tarah namaz nahi parhate. To Abu Ishaq ne kaha: Raha main, Allah ki qasam! Beshak main unhe Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki namaz parhata tha, us se kami na karta. Main Isha ki namaz parhata, pehli do mein theharta aur aakhri do mein halki karta. Unhon ne kaha: Ae Abu Ishaq! Tum se yahi gumaan hai. Phir unhon ne un ke sath ek shakhs, ya chand shakhs, Kufa ki taraf bheje. Phir unhon ne Kufa walon se us ke bare mein poochha. Aur koi masjid na chhori magar us ke bare mein poochha, aur wo achhayi ki tareef karte. Yahan tak ke Bani Abs ki ek masjid mein dakhil hue. Phir un mein se ek shakhs khada hua jise Usama bin Qatada kaha jata hai, us ki kuniyat Abu Sa'da hai. To us ne kaha: Raha jab tum ne hamein qasam di hai, Sa'd lashkar ke sath na chalta tha, barabari se taqseem na karta tha aur faisle mein insaf na karta tha. Sa'd ne kaha: Raha main, Allah ki qasam! Main teen duayein karunga: Ae Allah! Agar Tera ye banda jhoota hai, riyakari aur shohrat ke liye khada hua hai to us ki umar lambi kar, us ka faqr lamba kar aur use fitnon se dochar kar. Phir baad mein jab us se poochha jata to kehta: Budha fitne mein mubtala, mujhe Sa'd ki bad-dua lagi. Abd al-Malik ne kaha [hadith ke ek rawi]: Phir main ne use baad mein dekha, budhape se us ki bhanwein us ki aankhon par gir gayi thein, aur beshak wo raston mein londiyon ke peechhe padta aur unhe ishara karta."
"262","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Barza (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Fajr parhte jabke hum mein se ek apne sathi ko pehchanta, aur us mein saath se sau tak parhte. Aur Zuhr parhte jab suraj dhal jata, aur Asr jabke hum mein se ek Madina ke door tareen hisse ki taraf jata phir laut-ta jabke suraj zinda hota. Aur Isha ko raat ke tihayi tak muakkhar karne ki parwah na karte."
"263","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm al-Fadl se Ibn Abbas ke hawale se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Beshak Umm al-Fadl ne use [wa al-mursalat urfa] parhte suna. To unhon ne farmaya: Ae mere bete! Allah ki qasam! Tum ne is surat ke parhne se mujhe yaad dila diya. Beshak ye aakhri hai jo main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se Maghrib mein parhte suna."
"264","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jubair bin Mut'im (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko Maghrib mein Tur parhte suna."
"265","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bara (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) safar mein they to Isha mein do rakaton mein se ek mein Teen aur Zaitoon parhi."
"266","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Muadh bin Jabal (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath namaz parhte, phir apni qaum ke paas aate aur unhe namaz parhate. Phir unhon ne unhe Baqara parhayi. Unhon ne kaha: Phir ek shakhs hata aur halki namaz parhi. Phir ye baat Muadh ko pahunchi. To unhon ne kaha: Beshak wo munafiq hai. Phir ye baat us shakhs ko pahunchi. To wo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak hum aise log hain jo apne hathon se kaam karte hain aur apne oonton se pani pilate hain. Aur beshak Muadh ne kal raat hamein namaz parhayi aur Baqara parhi. To main hata. Phir us ne dawa kiya ke main munafiq hun. To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ae Muadh! Kya tum fitna dalne wale ho? Teen martaba. Parho [suraj aur us ki roshni] aur [apne Rab ke naam ki tasbeeh karo jo sab se buland hai] aur is jaisi."
"267","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Mas'ud al-Ansari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Allah ki qasam! Beshak main subah ki namaz se falan ki wajah se peechhe rehta hun jo hamein is mein lambi karata hai. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko kabhi naseehat mein is din se zyada ghazab-naak nahi dekha. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Ae logon! Beshak tum mein nafrat dilane wale hain. Phir tum mein se jo logon ko namaz parhaye use chahiye ke mukhtasar kare. Kyunke un mein budha, kamzor aur hajat-mand hai."
"268","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi logon ko namaz parhaye to use chahiye ke halki kare. Kyunke un mein kamzor, beemar aur budha hai. Aur jab tum mein se koi apne liye namaz parhe to jitna chahe lambi kare."
"269","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) namaz mukhtasar farmate aur mukammal farmate."
"270","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kabhi kisi imam ke peechhe Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se halki aur mukammal namaz nahi parhi. Aur beshak Aap bachche ka rona sunte to halki kar dete, is dar se ke us ki maan fitne mein pad jaye."
"271","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak main namaz mein dakhil hota hun jabke main use lambi karna chahta hun. Phir main bachche ka rona sunta hun to apni namaz mein kami kar deta hun, us se jo main janta hun us ki maan ko us ke rone se sakht takleef hoti hai."
"272","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bara (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka ruku aur sajda, dono sajdon ke darmiyan, aur jab ruku se apna sar uthate, qiyam aur quood ke siwa, barabar ke qareeb they."
"273","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Beshak main tumhe namaz parhane mein kotahi nahi karunga jaisa main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko hamein namaz parhate dekha. Thabit ne kaha [is hadith ke rawi]: Anas aisa karte they jo main tumhe karte nahi dekhta. Jab wo ruku se apna sar uthate to khade rehte yahan tak ke kehne wala kehta ke wo bhool gaye. Aur dono sajdon ke darmiyan, yahan tak ke kehne wala kehta ke wo bhool gaye."
"274","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bara bin Azib (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke peechhe namaz parhte. Phir jab Aap farmate: Allah ne us ki sun li jo Us ki hamd kare, to hum mein se koi apni peeth na jhukata yahan tak ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apni peshani zameen par rakhte."
"275","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apne ruku aur sajde mein kasrat se kehte: Ae Allah! Ae hamare Rab! Tu paak hai aur Teri hamd ke sath. Ae Allah! Mujhe bakhsh de. Quran par amal karte hue."
"276","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko saat haddiyon par sajda karne ka hukm diya gaya, aur baal aur kapda na sametne ka: Peshani, dono hath, dono ghutne aur dono paon."
"277","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Malik bin Buhaina (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab namaz parhte to apne dono hathon ke darmiyan kushadgi farmate yahan tak ke Aap ki baghalon ki safedi zahir ho jati."
"278","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab Eid ke din nikalte to neze ka hukm farmate. Phir wo Aap ke samne rakha jata aur Aap us ki taraf namaz parhte, jabke log Aap ke peechhe hote. Aur Aap safar mein aisa karte. To isi se hukmaranon ne use apnaya."
"279","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai ke Wo apni sawari ko aade rakhte aur us ki taraf namaz parhte."
"280","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Juhaifa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Bilal ko azan kehte dekha. To main azan ke sath un ke munh ka yahan aur wahan peechha karne laga."
"281","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Juhaifa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko chamde ke surkh khaime mein dekha. Aur main ne Bilal ko dekha ke unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka wuzu ka pani liya. Aur main ne logon ko dekha ke wo us wuzu ke pani ki taraf daudte. Phir jo us mein se kuchh pata wo us se masah karta, aur jo us mein se kuchh na pata wo apne sathi ke hath ki tari se leta. Phir main ne Bilal ko dekha ke unhon ne neza liya aur gaada. Aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) surkh jode mein kapda upar kiye nikle. Aap ne neze ki taraf logon ko do rakatein parhayein. Aur main ne logon aur janwaron ko dekha ke wo neze ke samne se guzarte."
"282","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main gadhi par sawar aaya jabke main us din baloghat ke qareeb tha. Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Mina mein baghair deewar ke namaz parha rahe they. Phir main saf ke kuchh hisse ke samne se guzra aur gadhi ko charne ke liye chhor diya. Phir main saf mein dakhil ho gaya. Phir mujh par is ka inkar na kiya gaya."
"283","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, Abu Salih al-Samman ne kaha: Main ne Abu Sa'id al-Khudri ko juma ke din dekha ke wo kisi cheez ki taraf namaz parh rahe they jo unhe logon se chhupaye. Phir Bani Abi Mu'ait mein se ek naujawan ne un ke samne se guzarna chaha. To Abu Sa'id ne us ke seene mein dhakka diya. Phir naujawan ne dekha to usے un ke samne ke siwa koi rasta na mila. Phir wo guzarne ke liye lauta to Abu Sa'id ne use pehli se zyada zor se dhakka diya. Phir us ne Abu Sa'id ko bura kaha. Phir wo Marwan ke paas dakhil hua aur us se Abu Sa'id se jo mila us ki shikayat ki. Aur Abu Sa'id us ke peechhe Marwan ke paas dakhil hue. To us ne kaha: Tumhe aur apne bhatije ko kya hua, ae Abu Sa'id? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Jab tum mein se koi kisi cheez ki taraf namaz parhe jo use logon se chhupaye, phir koi us ke samne se guzarna chahe to use chahiye ke use dhakka de. Phir agar wo inkar kare to use chahiye ke us se lade, kyunke wo to shaitan hai."
"284","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Juhaim se Busr bin Sa'id ke hawale se riwayat hai ke Zaid bin Khalid ne use Abu Juhaim ki taraf bheja taake un se poochhe ke unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se namazi ke samne se guzarne wale ke bare mein kya suna hai. To Abu Juhaim ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Agar namazi ke samne se guzarne wala janta ke us par gunah mein se kya hai to us ka chalees tak theharna us ke liye us ke samne se guzarne se behtar hota."
"285","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki namaz ki jagah aur deewar ke darmiyan bakri ke guzarne ka fasla tha."
"286","[AI-translation] Hazrat Salama (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mimbar ke paas masjid ki deewar itni thi ke bakri mushkil se guzar sakti thi."
"287","[AI-translation] Hazrat Salama bin al-Akwa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, Yazid bin Abi Ubaid ne kaha: Main Salama bin al-Akwa ke sath aata tha. Phir wo us sutun ke paas namaz parhte jo mushaf ke paas hai. To main ne arz kiya: Ae Abu Muslim! Main tumhe dekhta hun ke tum is sutun ke paas namaz ka khayal rakhte ho. Unhon ne kaha: Beshak main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko dekha ke Aap us ke paas namaz ka khayal rakhte they."
"288","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) namaz parhte jabke wo Aap ke aur Qibla ke darmiyan ghar ke bistar par janaze ki tarah aade thein."
"289","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) namaz parhte jabke main Aap ke bistar par aade leti hoti. Phir jab Aap witr parhna chahte to mujhe jagate aur main witr parhti."
"290","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se Masrooq ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Un ke paas [Aisha ke paas] us ka zikr hua jo namaz ko kaat-ta hai: Kutta, gadha aur aurat. To unhon ne farmaya: Tum ne hamein gadon aur kutton se tashbeeh di. Allah ki qasam! Beshak main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko namaz parhte dekha jabke main bistar par Aap ke aur Qibla ke darmiyan leti hui thi. Phir mujhe hajat hoti to main baithna na-pasand karti ke main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko takleef dun. Phir main Aap ke qadmon ke paas se nikal jati."
"291","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Kya tum ne hamein kutte aur gadhe ke barabar kar diya? Beshak main ne apne aap ko bistar par leti dekha. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aate aur bistar ke darmiyan mein hote aur namaz parhte. To main Aap ke samne aana na-pasand karti. Phir main bistar ke pairon ki taraf se nikal jati yahan tak ke apne lihaaf se nikal jati."
"292","[AI-translation] Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke samne soti jabke mere dono paon Aap ke Qibla mein hote. Phir jab Aap sajda karte to mujhe dabate aur main apne dono paon samet leti. Phir jab Aap khade hote to main unhe phaila deti. Unhon ne kaha: Aur ghar us din chiraghon ke baghair they."
"293","[AI-translation] Hazrat Maimuna (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) namaz parhte jabke main Aap ke barabar hoti, aur main haiz se hoti. Aur kabhi jab Aap sajda karte to Aap ka kapda mujhe lagta."
"294","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek sawal karne wale ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se ek kapde mein namaz ke bare mein poochha. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum sab ke paas do kapde hain?"
"295","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi ek kapde mein namaz na parhe jabke us ke kandhon par kuchh na ho."
"296","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar bin Abi Salama (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko ek kapde mein lipt kar namaz parhte dekha, Umm Salama ke ghar mein, us ke dono kinare apne kandhon par rakhe hue."
"297","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, Muhammad bin al-Munkadir ne kaha: Main ne Jabir bin Abdullah ko ek kapde mein namaz parhte dekha. Aur unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko ek kapde mein namaz parhte dekha."
